>> title: Cajun Seasoning
>> category: Spice Blends & Marinades
>> tags: cajun, louisiana, spice blend, no-cook, pantry
>> counters: Meat and Three
>> aka: creole seasoning, blackened seasoning, Cajun spice
>> pairs-with: jambalaya, dirty-rice
>> servings: 16
>> time: 10 min

>> step: whisk together
Whisk @sweet paprika{3%Tbs} and @cayenne{1%Tbs} together in a #bowl{}.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @garlic powder{1%Tbs} and @onion powder{1%Tbs} into @&(~1)paprika base{}.

>> step: crumble in
Crumble @dried thyme{1%tsp} and @dried oregano{1%tsp} between your palms into @&(~1)mixture{}.

>> step: stir in
Stir @black pepper{2%tsp}, @white pepper{1%tsp}, and @kosher salt{1%Tbs} into @&(~1)blend{}.
